  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing Human Trafficking and Smuggling of Human Beings in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Increasing public awareness and access to rescue support &#x2013; sensitizing 40,000 vulnerable individuals, training 180 community members put information about assistance in the hands of 700 returned victims and survivors of trafficking.
2.	Economic impact through training and business opportunities &#x2013; targeting 600 returnees/survivors to increase their hire ability and life skills and 100 returnees/survivors for educational advancement.
3.	Changing the landscape of knowledge-sharing through High Level Advocacy Engagement and Capacity Building &#x2013; knowledge-sharing with 50 industry experts across counter human trafficking organizations, government, and law enforcement and capacity building of MeCAHT staff.</narrative>
  </description>
